开展数模混合集成设计，明确数字与模拟模块间的接口时序、电源/时钟规划及控制逻辑，支撑芯片级低功耗架构实现与系统级指标收敛，确保芯片满足终端产品功能与性能需求。  \n4. 配合测试、NPI及质量团队推进芯片量产导入与良率提升；参与竞品技术分析、平台演进规划及成本优化工作，持续迭代升级MCU数字平台架构。","Require":"1.微电子、集成电路、电子工程等相关专业硕士及以上学历；5 年以上数字 IC 设计经验，有 MCU/SoC 量产芯片的完整设计经历，熟悉从规格定义到量产的全流程。\"\n2.精通 Verilog/SystemVerilog RTL 设计；熟悉 MCU 架构（ARM Cortex-M / RISC-V）及 AMBA 总线体系（AHB/APB/AXI）；掌握低功耗设计技术（UPF、电源域规划、时钟门控）与 CDC/时序收敛方法；熟悉数字设计全流程（综合、DFT、STA 及后端协作），具备芯片级集成与顶层把控能力。\"\n3.熟练使用 Synopsys/Cadence 主流设计与验证工具链；具备 UVM 验证环境搭建与用例开发能力；掌握 Python/Perl/Shell/TCL 等脚本工具，可完成流程自动化；具备较强的系统思维，擅长多约束条件下的工程取舍。\"\n4.具备较强的跨团队协同能力，可与模拟、固件、验证、测试团队高效配合；具备优秀的技术文档输出能力、问题复盘与项目闭环能力；能快速跟进行业前沿技术方案。\"\n","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-04T10:16:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"da1bf